@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### List Active Watchlist Entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/watchlist
Accept: application/json

### Add Vehicle to Watchlist (Normalised)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_type": "VEHICLE",
  "identifier": "ka 01 ab 1234",
  "name": "Stolen White SUV",
  "risk_level": "HIGH",
  "notes": "Wanted in connection with Case #402"
}

### Add Person to Watchlist (Requires Consent Reference)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_type": "PERSON",
  "identifier": "SUBJECT-402",
  "name": "Subject 402",
  "risk_level": "MEDIUM",
  "consent_reference": "CONSENT-2026-088"
}

### Soft Delete Watchlist Entry
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/watchlist/bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
